<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt"><I>Columbia Financial Proposal No.</I><I></I><I>&nbsp;8:</I> The Columbia <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Say-on-Pay</FONT></FONT> Frequency Proposal; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
