 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Our board of directors makes no recommendation of any kind as to the advisability of
purchasing shares of common stock in the offering. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>How Columbia Financial, Inc. Intends to Use the Proceeds of the Offering (page&nbsp;168) </B></P>
