adjusted minimum, minimum midpoint and maximum of the offering range. The table below assumes the merger consideration for the acquisition of Northfield Bancorp includes 30% cash with the remainder of the consideration in common stock of Columbia
Financial, Inc. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
