 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">
interest. The board of directors of Northfield Bancorp was aware of these interests and considered them, among other matters, in approving the Merger Agreement and related transactions. These
interests include: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
