<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">Columbia Financial, Inc. and Columbia Bank have entered into an employment agreement with
Steven&nbsp;M.&nbsp;Klein, to be effective as of the effective time of the Merger, in connection with his appointment as Senior Executive Vice President and Chief Operating Officer of Columbia Financial, Inc. and Columbia Bank following the
completion of the Merger and the Bank Merger; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
