<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>In deciding how to vote, you should consider carefully all of the information included in this document and its Annexes, as well as the following risk
factors. In this section of the Joint Proxy Statement/Prospectus, the terms &#8220;we,&#8221; &#8220;us&#8221; and &#8220;our&#8221; refer to Columbia Financial and its consolidated subsidiaries or its successor Columbia Financial, Inc., Columbia
Bank MHC and Columbia Bank unless the context requires otherwise. </I></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:24pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B><U>Risk Factor Summary </U></B></P>
