range. At the adjusted minimum, it is assumed that 41,800,140 shares issued as merger consideration are used to satisfy the minimum offering requirement. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
