<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">assuming Columbia Financial closed its offering at the minimum of the offering range, that Northfield Bancorp
stockholders would own approximately 23% of the combined enterprise following completion of the Merger; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
