<TD WIDTH="3%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">&#149;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">the enhanced potential for liquidity to Northfield Bancorp stockholders given the increased market capitalization
of the combined company from $508&nbsp;million on January&nbsp;29, 2026, the latest practicable day before the announcement of the Merger, to approximately $2.59&nbsp;billion on a pro&nbsp;forma basis also as of such date after giving effect to the
Merger with Columbia Financial assuming the closing of the Columbia Financial offering at the minimum of the offering range; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
