for alternative transactions or engage in discussions regarding such proposals, including the requirement for Northfield Bancorp to pay Columbia Financial a termination fee of $23.7&nbsp;million in certain circumstances; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
