closing<B> </B>price per share on January&nbsp;30, 2025, compared to: (i)&nbsp;tangible book value (&#8220;TBV&#8221;) per share; (ii)&nbsp;last twelve months core earnings per share (&#8220;LTM Core EPS&#8221;) as calculated by S&amp;P Global
Market Intelligence; (iii)&nbsp;estimated 2026 earnings per share (&#8220;2026 EPS&#8221;) based on consensus analyst estimates as shown by S&amp;P Global Market Intelligence; and (iv)&nbsp;estimated 2027 earnings per share (&#8220;2027 EPS&#8221;)
based on consensus analyst estimates as shown by S&amp;P Global Market Intelligence. The estimates published by Wall Street research analysts were not prepared in connection with the Merger or at the request of Raymond James and may not prove to be
accurate. Raymond James reviewed the minimum, 25th percentile, mean, median, 75th percentile and the maximum relative valuation multiples of the selected public companies and compared them to the corresponding valuation multiples for Northfield
