federal income tax purposes to stockholders of Northfield Bancorp who receive shares of Columbia Financial, Inc. as merger consideration; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
