<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">Columbia Financial&#8217;s past record of integrating acquisitions and of realizing expected financial and other
benefits of such acquisitions and the strength of Columbia Financial&#8217;s management and infrastructure, which can be leveraged to successfully complete the integration process; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
