<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">the fact that nine of 13 total directors of the surviving corporation will be members of the Columbia Financial
board of directors, and that all Columbia Financial directors as of the effective time of the Merger will continue as directors of the surviving corporation; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
