presented in the tables below may not correspond to the data presented in Columbia Financial&#8217;s historical financial statements, or the data presented under the section <I>&#8220;</I><I>Description of the Merger&#8212; Opinion of Northfield
Bancorp</I><I>&#8217;</I><I>s Financial Advisor,</I><I>&#8221;</I> as a result of the different periods, assumptions and methods used to compute the financial data presented. </P>
