<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The resulting transaction multiples and core deposit premiums for the selected transactions were compared with the corresponding transaction
multiples and core deposit premiums for the proposed Merger based on the indicative transaction value for the proposed Merger of $14.25 per outstanding share of Northfield Bancorp common stock and using historical financial information for
