more U.S. persons or (ii)&nbsp;has a valid election in effect under applicable Treasury Regulations to be treated as U.S. person; or </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
