</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">This discussion assumes that the U.S. Holders hold their shares of Northfield Bancorp common stock as a capital asset
within the meaning of Section&nbsp;1221 of the Code, which generally means as property held for investment. Further, this </P>
