<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">(1)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left"><I>Cash. </I>The cash payments will be paid in exchange for the termination of each executive&#8217;s
employment agreement as provided in each executive&#8217;s settlement agreement. In addition, for Mr.&nbsp;Klein only, the cash payment includes a payment in the amount of $2,900,000 in exchange for a <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">two-year</FONT>
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-competition</FONT> and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-solicitation</FONT> restriction. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
