restricted shares or other equity or equity-based awards or interests, or grant any person any right to acquire any Northfield Bancorp securities under a Northfield Bancorp equity plan or otherwise; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
