Merger set forth in Sections 7.1 or Section 7.2 of the Merger Agreement not being satisfied by January&nbsp;31, 2027, or (ii) prevent, delay or impair in any material respect its ability to consummate the transactions contemplated by the Merger
Agreement (including the Bank Merger); or </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
