<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">by Columbia Financial, if, prior to the receipt of Northfield Bancorp stockholder approval, (i)&nbsp;Northfield
Bancorp or the Northfield Bancorp board of directors withholds, withdraws, modifies or qualifies its recommendation in favor of the Northfield Merger Proposal or (ii)&nbsp;Northfield Bancorp or the Northfield Bancorp board of directors breaches in
any material respect its obligations related to calling, giving notice of, and commencing the Northfield Bancorp stockholder meeting or its <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">&#8220;no-shop&#8221;</FONT> obligations related to third party acquisition
proposals under the Merger Agreement; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
