<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-cash,</FONT> <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-tax</FONT> deductible goodwill impairment charge and $580,000 additional tax expense related to options that expired in May 2025. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
