<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">The year ended December&nbsp;31, 2025, included a $41.0&nbsp;million
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-cash,</FONT> <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-tax</FONT> deductible goodwill impairment charge. The year ended December&nbsp;31, 2024, included a $3.4&nbsp;million,
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-tax,</FONT> gain on the sale of property, and $683,000, <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-tax,</FONT> of severance expense. The year ended December&nbsp;31, 2023, includes $440,000, <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-tax,</FONT> of severance expense. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
