<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-accruing</FONT> loans and loans 90 days or more past due and still accruing (excluding PCD loans), included in total loans
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">held-for-investment,</FONT></FONT> net, and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-performing</FONT> loans
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">held-for-sale,</FONT></FONT> included in loans <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">held-for-sale.</FONT></FONT> </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
