<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Reduction of fee income as Northfield Bancorp historical fee income is limited by the Durbin Amendment
limitations on fee income. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">(8)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Adjustment to <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-interest</FONT> expense is the amortization of the core
deposit intangible over 10 years using the sum of the years&#8217; digits amortization method net of a $1.174&nbsp;million annual <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-tax</FONT> reduction in Northfield Bank ESOP expense resulting from the
termination of the Northfield Bank ESOP. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">(9)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Assumes a marginal tax rate of 27.0% on <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-tax</FONT> income. The adjustment
also includes the estimated impact of the loss of a portion of the real estate investment trust tax benefit realized by Northfield Bancorp on a historical basis owing to the increase in total assets in excess of $8&nbsp;billion estimated to equal
$0.144&nbsp;million annually on a <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-tax</FONT> basis. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
