</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">At December&nbsp;31, 2025, the aggregate amount of uninsured deposits (deposits in amounts greater than or
equal to $250,000, which is the maximum amount for federal deposit insurance) was $3.3&nbsp;billion. This amount included municipal deposits of $944.6&nbsp;million, which are collateralized, and intercompany deposits of $42.6&nbsp;million. </P>
