decreased $1.1&nbsp;million, or 0.6%, to $181.3&nbsp;million from $182.4&nbsp;million for the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2023. The decrease was primarily attributable to a decrease in compensation </P>

 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">216 </P>

