 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Loan Portfolio Maturities.</I></B> The following tables summarize the scheduled
repayments of Northfield Bank&#8217;s loan portfolio and weighted average contractual rate by loan type at December&nbsp;31, 2025.&nbsp;Demand loans (loans having no stated repayment schedule or maturity) and overdraft loans are reported as being
due in the year ending December&nbsp;31, 2026. Maturities are based on the final contractual payment date and do not reflect the effect of prepayments, repricing and scheduled principal amortization. </P>
