<P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:1.150000em; font-family:Times New Roman">Base salaries are subject to annual review in December of each year based on the Compensation</P></DIV></DIV></TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<TD VALIGN="top"></TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top"><DIV STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt; display: table-row;"><DIV STYLE="display: table-cell">
<P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:0.500000em; font-family:Times New Roman">&#149;</P></DIV><DIV STYLE="display: table-cell">
<P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:1.150000em; font-family:Times New Roman">Provide a salary that is market competitive;</P></DIV></DIV>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P><DIV STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt; display: table-row;"><DIV STYLE="display: table-cell">
<P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:0.500000em; font-family:Times New Roman">&#149;</P></DIV><DIV STYLE="display: table-cell">
<P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:1.150000em; font-family:Times New Roman">Promote the retention of executives; and</P></DIV></DIV>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P><DIV STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt; display: table-row;"><DIV STYLE="display: table-cell">
<P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:0.500000em; font-family:Times New Roman">&#149;</P></DIV><DIV STYLE="display: table-cell">
<P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:1.150000em; font-family:Times New Roman">Provide fixed compensation that reflects the scope, scale, and complexity of the executive&#8217;s role.</P></DIV></DIV></TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Committee&#8217;s assessment of the executive&#8217;s individual performance during the year, a review of peer group
practices for similar positions and consideration of base salary in relation to incentive compensation opportunities. Following such review, in September 2024 the Compensation Committee increased the base salaries for our
NEOs.</P></TD></TR></TABLE>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">274 </P>

</DIV></Center>


