 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Merger-related expenses are recorded in the Consolidated Statements of Income and are
expensed as incurred. Direct acquisition and other charges incurred in connection with the acquisition of the RSI Entities totaled $193,000 for the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2023. There were no expenses recorded for the years ended
December&nbsp;31, 2025 and 2024. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>(4) &#8195;Debt Securities Available for Sale </B></P>
