totaled $46.2&nbsp;million and $50.1&nbsp;million at December&nbsp;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. The Company also offers its customers reciprocal deposit arrangements, which provide FDIC deposit insurance for accounts that would otherwise exceed
deposit insurance limits, which totaled $262.1&nbsp;million and $186.1&nbsp;million as of December&nbsp;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. </P>
