</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Expected future stock award expense related to the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-vested</FONT>
restricted awards as of December&nbsp;31, 2025, is $2.2&nbsp;million over an average period of 1.3 years. Expected future stock award expense related to the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-vested</FONT> performance share awards as of
December&nbsp;31, 2025, was $686,000 over a weighted average period of 1.3 years. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Upon the exercise of stock options, management expects
to utilize treasury stock as the source of issuance for these shares. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
